  "detail_url": "https://api.sam.gov/prod/opportunities/v1/noticedesc?noticeid=cb7eb77ad9d54fc2b0e36e69b2e7ee2a",
  "detail_text": "This is a Request for Quote (RFQ) for a Total Small Business Set Aside for Various Quantities of Brand: Glenair Connectors Please submit your quote to terra.s.roberts.civ@us.navy.mil on or before the closing date and time: Mar 09, 2026 11:00 am CDT. Late quotes will not be considered. Your quote should include the following information: Unit Price: For the specified Various Quantities of Brand: Glenair Connectors Shipping Cost: If shipping is not included in the unit price, please provide a separate line item for shipping costs. CAGE Code: Your company's Commercial and Government Entity (CAGE) code. Lead Time: Estimated delivery timeframe after receipt of order. WAWF Capability: Confirmation of your ability to invoice through Wide Area Workflow (WAWF). All Invoices are NET30 and submitted through WAWF. Please refer to the attached document for the product description, quantity, and other pertinent details. The Government will award this procurement based on the best value, considering price, delivery, quality, and past performance. Please carefully review all attachments.",
